ChatGPT
Apologies for the confusion. If you prefer to use npm test to run your
tests, you'll need to set up a testing framework such as Mocha or Jest.
Here's an example using Jest:

pick.js:

```javascript
class Pick {
  constructor(wrestlerName) {
    this.wrestlerName = wrestlerName;
    // You can add more properties relevant to the pick if needed
  }
}

module.exports = Pick;
```

pick.test.js:

```javascript
const Pick = require('./pick');

describe('Pick', () => {
